@startuml
title BrewLite - deployment topology (Vercel production target)
node "Local developer" {
 artifact "Browser" as B1
 node "Docker Compose" { artifact "Next.js :3000" as W1; artifact "NestJS :3001" as A1; database "PostgreSQL :5432" as D1 }
 B1 --> W1 : HTTPS
 B1 --> A1 : HTTPS API
 A1 --> D1
}
cloud "CI/CD (GitHub Actions)" as CI {
 artifact "Lint / Test / Build" as Q
 artifact "Release artifacts tagged by Git SHA/version" as I
 Q --> I
}
cloud "Vercel (awaiting project setup)" as V {
 artifact "Next.js Web project\nHTTPS + preview/production" as W
 artifact "NestJS API Function\nHTTPS + /health" as A
 W --> A : HTTPS API
}
database "Managed PostgreSQL\nprivate credentials / TLS" as D
A --> D : TLS PostgreSQL
note right of V
 Secrets: Vercel project environment variables
 Rollback: previous production deployment
end note
I --> V : deploy API and web after quality gate
CI ..> V : Vercel CLI token (GitHub Environment secret)
@enduml
